Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.16,0:01:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person has been chasing me all the way from Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:02:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I still can't determine his cultivation level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:11.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if you have the stones to operate the teleportation formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:12.48,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1590,531)\fad(300,000)}Na Duo\NFive Elements Planet's cultivator\NEarly stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you think you can escape ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a powerful Divine Sense !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.80,0:02:22.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,After a single attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Nascent Soul is already at the brink of collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.44,0:02:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:28.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,his cultivation level ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,His power feels familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This cannot continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.44,0:02:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cannot let him take the initiative,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:42.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,cause if he does, I will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to fight back to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:56.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,His flag isn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.19,0:02:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If he finishes is, it will trigger a tribulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:03.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to find this kind of artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,on this waste of a planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:10.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, before this trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.96,0:03:12.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I refined another nearly-finished restriction flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Looks like it can threaten him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior has been following me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.24,0:03:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,with great killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.80,0:03:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does Senior want from me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,If my cultivation was at its prime,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,this would be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:26.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I only recovered 30% of my power...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I fight a tribulation now, I will get hurt again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:34.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior, give me the bag you found in the Land of the Ancient God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Land of the Ancient God ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.52,0:03:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this what Senior wants ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:47.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,I got seriously injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So I went to the Land of the Ancient God to find treasures to help me recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.12,0:03:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I got into some trouble there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Blood Sea Warriors chased me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.76,0:04:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,so in order to safeguard my findings,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:07.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had no other choice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:09.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,but to hide my bag of holding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wanted to take it back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.80,0:04:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,But as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:16.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,it ended up in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.68,0:04:18.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have returned the bag to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.68,0:04:19.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will now take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.42,0:04:46.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't be rash !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:50.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did Senior go back on his word ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:52.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Was the red lightning you used before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ji Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:59.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior, you really are full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.56,0:05:02.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not only do you have a treasure that can attract a tribulation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:04.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you also have the Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Senior doesn't have anything else
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,then Junior will take his leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:11.14,Second,,0,0,0,,Do you want to breakthrough your Ji Realm bottleneck ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:14.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you know what this is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:21.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ji Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,On my home planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.44,0:05:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's called the Five Colored Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:27.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This wasn't originally mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.52,0:05:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was gifted to me by a friend
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,as he was dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.24,0:05:34.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,You remind me of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.40,0:05:37.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the whole Cultivation Alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:39.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ji Realm cultivators are very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,I cannot tell the properties of your Ji Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I know how you can breakthrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:47.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Cultivation Planet Crystal is given
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,to a country when it reaches rank 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:52.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The old monsters of the Cultivation Alliance use their powers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.76,0:05:54.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,to form the crystal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a rank 6 cultivation country's national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.12,0:06:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you obtain and refine it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can breakthrough your Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you obtain the crystal and get the qualifications
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to leave this waste of a planet
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:16.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can come find me on the Five Elements Planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.64,0:06:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,my name is Na Duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:24.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I managed to avoid this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.88,0:06:36.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can reach Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.40,0:06:39.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I may have a chance to get the Cultivation Planet Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:40.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to breakthrough my Ji Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,But for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.07,0:06:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.24,0:06:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understanding the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,is crucial for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.08,0:06:51.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I have spent my whole life
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.84,0:06:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,following the demonic path.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to breakthrough,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.68,0:06:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is only one way:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.32,0:07:00.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1602,497)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin's avatar\NEarly stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.08,0:07:02.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,becoming a mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:09.64,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1577,441)\fad(300,000)}Four Sect Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Four Sect Alliance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:31.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a rank 4 cultivation country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:38.64,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1559,429)\fad(300,300)}Lu Xing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.44,0:07:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's rest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:44.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sir, are you passing by or staying ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.52,0:07:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I see that you carry medicinal herbs in your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:52.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,could possibly be a traveling doctor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Lu Xing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:58.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you have any medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:00.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cure the evil wind. (regular cold)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is someone sick ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.32,0:08:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,A servant girl is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are still 7 days away from the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the medecine prescribed by the doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.24,0:08:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.64,0:08:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is my opportunity to enter the mortal world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.56,0:08:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:26.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:27.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,just look from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.16,0:08:29.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is no need to go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:32.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please stretch out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:42.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,She clearly isn't a servant, but the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:44.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Poison ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.32,0:08:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have her eat it raw, she will be cured by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:57.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This looks like an ordinary willow tree leaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.00,0:09:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this guy isn't a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.60,0:09:08.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is clearly a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,A hundred-years old willow leaf !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to consume it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there any trick to using this leaf ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:20.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Eating it raw is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect that in just 400 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:46.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I could accumulate so much killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.00,0:09:49.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I killed way too many people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:51.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I allow this aura to grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.68,0:09:52.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will corrupt my Dao Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The killing intent can be domineering
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and used for spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if I want to turn into a mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.20,0:10:04.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will ententually dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:24.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best I can do is condense it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:26.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:27.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey Brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,your leaves are really magical.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:29.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,My daught-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,My servant feels much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.52,0:10:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's toast !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:48.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since I drank with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.40,0:10:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come on, cheers !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've heard you talk about Xing Fen Tower countless times.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.16,0:11:05.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,This time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will see if you're just bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.84,0:11:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,You'll be drunk soon anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:15.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll wait for you to pass out and I'll start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.46,0:11:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:17.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's toast for him !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.04,0:11:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a drinker !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come, cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:28.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,You should drink less, we have to keep guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:29.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,since I saw this side of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, without noticing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I absorbed spiritual energy extremely fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.92,0:11:53.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1558,491)\fad(300,300)}Wang Lin's avatar\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It made me breakthrough to the Middle stage already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems that distancing myself from cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:11:59.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,to become a mortal
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:00.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the right path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, I will dance for you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.92,0:12:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have fun ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:07.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Am I making a fool of myself ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:08.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Of course you are !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:13.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look over here !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Quality woven clothes !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cold powder ! Cold powder !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.36,0:12:21.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:22.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't keep staring at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.92,0:12:25.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you are noticed, we will be troubled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:26.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Lu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are these black pillars ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.60,0:12:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those are Immortal pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.00,0:12:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place is my country's capital
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.84,0:12:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's protected by Immortals, hence the Immortal pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are Immortals living inside the pillars.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although they are merely Foundation Establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's rare to protect the mortal world like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:48.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to know so much about Immortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:51.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of the Four Sect Alliance ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:54.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are 4 cultivation sects
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.44,0:12:56.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,in our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:13:00.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The righteous and virtuous White Cloud Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:04.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Water Ink Sect, with its bustling rivers and waterfalls.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Green Wood Sect, blessed by the sky and the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.40,0:13:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the Black Soul Sect, hidden in darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:16.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 4 sects are relatively independent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:18.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,They each collect disciples in the mortal world.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:21.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whenever there's a big event, they cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.08,0:13:24.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why it's called the Four Sect Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.60,0:13:26.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.92,0:13:29.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,my dream was to become an Immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,But the crown prince was so kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might have become an Immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:41.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I heard that cultivation depends on talent and opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.68,0:13:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's not something you decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life is short.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.36,0:13:47.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's better to be happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know me well Brother !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Lu,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:56.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's part ways here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The young lady asked me to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here are 10 taels of gold,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.64,0:14:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,consider it your payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:02.76,Second,,0,0,0,,Note: 1 tael = 37.5g
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:04.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.36,0:14:19.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1628,423)\fad(300,000)}Spoiler
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You old pervert !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,You came to my shop to see the women changing their clothes ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:21.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Deserved !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:22.88,Second,,0,0,0,,At such an age, how could you be so lewd ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.48,0:14:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll hit you every time I see you !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Get lost !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:28.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you to death !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.92,0:14:33.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.60,0:14:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,your forehead is wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.65,0:14:36.65,Second,,0,0,0,,(Note: sign of luck, talent)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.60,0:14:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,energy envelops your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must be special !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.36,0:14:41.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've hidden my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.28,0:14:43.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person is just a mortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.40,0:14:45.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,he cannot see through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:48.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,If no one guides you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you will never reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:52.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.69,0:14:54.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,How pitiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.25,0:14:55.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.16,0:14:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:02.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I know how to make you reach Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:11.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.01,0:15:12.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,please teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.92,0:15:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The moment I get hungry,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't remember anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I know a very good restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go there and talk while we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Delicious !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:30.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Bring me another duck !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:34.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And 2 jars of wine !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.76,0:15:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Try some, it's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.92,0:15:42.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.18,0:15:43.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can I reach Soul Formation ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.20,0:15:47.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,This, it's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.34,0:15:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait until I finish eating this piece
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man is really strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:55.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,He can see through my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.24,0:15:57.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it's not a coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:15:59.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,then his cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be at least Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:13.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Formation stage requires one to understand the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:16.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I believe you already know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,In addition,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.52,0:16:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reach Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.20,0:16:21.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must form your own...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.84,0:16:23.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know what a domain is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.52,0:16:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,reflect on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:34.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once you comprehend what a domain is,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't be far from Soul Forma...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:44.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,...tion
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I need to use the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's continue when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,your forehead is wide,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,energy envelops your body,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you must be special !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.36,0:17:27.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:31.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.24,0:17:33.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,If no one guides you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:36.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you will never reach Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:38.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:41.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:43.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This old man
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't scam randomly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.08,0:17:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:52.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,if no one guides you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you will never reach Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:56.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You don't need to know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.64,0:17:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's find a place to relax
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.28,0:18:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:03.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.48,0:18:12.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.44,0:18:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,how long do you plan to rent ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the craft of our family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.28,0:18:24.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.72,0:18:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tie Zhu won't work with you in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.32,0:18:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I save enough money
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.32,0:18:32.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will go to the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:33.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,to become an official.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.16,0:18:38.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young man, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a garden in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although this shop has been empty for many years
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:54.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,and is dirty,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.72,0:18:56.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you should have everything you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:18:59.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This much ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:00.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,The place is yours then !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:18.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't catch me !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait a second !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.40,0:19:21.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I can catch you !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,No you won't  !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.36,0:19:24.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Be careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't make trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.28,0:19:27.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hidden from the world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.40,0:19:29.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,in a city of mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.04,0:19:33.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Far away for the bloody cultivation path,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,living life as a mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:36.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:40.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,this is really the way to understand the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:46.60,Second,,0,0,0,,Old man,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.09,0:19:48.47,Second,,0,0,0,,what do you want to do tonight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.16,0:19:50.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nascent Soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:52.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Middle stage Nascent Soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.73,0:19:56.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Should I help him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.83,0:22:44.99,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}As I mentioned before in the note of episode 32, the story of that bag of holding differs between the donghua and the novel. Na Duo was cultivating in the War God Shrine a technique to absorb the death energy of corpses. He was severly injured in combat and was recovering from his injuries there for thousands of years and Wang Lin stole his bag while he was uncounscious in his corpse state.\N\NThe explanation of "I hid it there for later" makes very little sense. When you know that Na Duo was so heavily injured that he literally became a corpse in a sect's graveyard in order to recover, the donghua's explanation pales in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.77,0:20:10.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}I've had my share of wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}now I want to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:14.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Is my destiny a wall of restrictions
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:20.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}that's blocking all my hopes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.17,0:20:20.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}for life ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.93,0:20:25.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}My flesh and blood witnessed the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:25.89,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.21,0:20:29.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}How do you navigate through the years passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:35.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Nirvana and rebirth are no longer
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.37,0:20:35.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}out of reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:40.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.69,0:20:40.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.05,0:20:44.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Renegades
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:44.81,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.81,0:20:48.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}Don't tell me that I overestimate myself
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:48.65,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300}and that the path to revenge leads to hell
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.89,0:20:52.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}because I don't see the harm in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:21:00.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}My new body opens its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.29,0:21:00.57,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}and awakens from its dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.69,0:21:08.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I have overcome many trials
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.81,0:21:08.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}to get this body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.33,0:21:15.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}No matter how many endless dark nights go by,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:15.77,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}I can still see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.17,0:21:25.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}By sticking to this thought, I will get it done
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:25.13,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600}by my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.01,0:22:01.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Returning to my body opened my eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:01.97,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}I need to continue my Immortal journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.97,0:22:09.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}With a flick of a finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.41,0:22:09.53,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}only my indomitable heart remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:18.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:18.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,600}Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.
